        <mo>:</mo>
        <mi>V</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mi>V</mi>
              <mo stretchy="false">^<!-- ^ --></mo>
            </mover>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle j:V\to {\hat {V}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/87a60385685068c31c11d672f3de034e5cfdf0bc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; margin-left: -0.027ex; width:10.11ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle j:V\to {\hat {V}}}"/></span> with the following property: given any representation <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt65" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwkA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"(ρ,&apos;&apos;W&apos;&apos;)"}},"i":0}}]}'>(ρ,<i>W</i>)</span> of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt66" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwkQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span> and <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt67" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwkg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"H"}},"i":0}}]}'>H</span>-equivariant linear map <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt73" id="mwkw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f:V\\to W"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f:V\to W}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>f</mi>
        <mo>:</mo>
        <mi>V</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mi>W</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle f:V\to W}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/574dffa1c85efaef6b6ef553ebd8ad9cf7f87fd6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:11.052ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle f:V\to W}"/></span>, there is a unique <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt68" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwlA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span>-equivariant linear map <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt74" id="mwlQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\hat{f}: \\hat{V}\\to W"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}:{\hat {V}}\to W}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mi>f</mi>
              <mo stretchy="false">^<!-- ^ --></mo>
            </mover>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <mo>:</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mi>V</mi>
              <mo stretchy="false">^<!-- ^ --></mo>
            </mover>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mi>W</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}:{\hat {V}}\to W}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3cb4b2825ce54d97cad118a8eb4118e122a8fa00" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:11.473ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}:{\hat {V}}\to W}"/></span> with <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mwlg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\hat{f}j=f"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}j=f}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mi>f</mi>
              <mo stretchy="false">^<!-- ^ --></mo>
            </mover>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <mi>j</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>f</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}j=f}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/67e009c902cdd1bb09692cc22b5e74ad9325e368" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:7.034ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}j=f}"/></span>. In other words, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt76" id="mwlw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\hat{f}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mi>f</mi>
              <mo stretchy="false">^<!-- ^ --></mo>
            </mover>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/14ce989fd75da938ec6f95a0cdb71037b23a11cb" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:1.699ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\hat {f}}}"/></span> is the unique map making the following <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commutative_diagram" title="Commutative diagram" id="mwmA">diagram commute</a>:<sup about="#mwt80" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwmQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwmg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwmw">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwnA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwnQ"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwng"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwnw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg/250px-Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" data-file-width="94" data-file-height="73" data-file-type="drawing" height="155" width="200" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg/500px-Universal_property_of_the_induced_representation_2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwoA"/></a></span></p>

<p id="mwoQ">The <b id="mwog">Frobenius formula</b> states that if <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt81" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwow" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"χ"}},"i":0}}]}'>χ</span> is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Character_theory" title="Character theory" id="mwpA">character</a> of the representation <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt82" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"σ"}},"i":0}}]}'>σ</span>, given by <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt83" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;χ&apos;&apos;(&apos;&apos;h&apos;&apos;) {{=}} Tr &apos;&apos;σ&apos;&apos;(&apos;&apos;h&apos;&apos;)"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>χ</i>(<i>h</i>) = Tr <i>σ</i>(<i>h</i>)</span>, then the character <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt84" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ψ"}},"i":0}}]}'>ψ</span> of the induced representation is given by</p>

<dl id="mwqA"><dd id="mwqQ"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt85" id="mwqg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\psi(g) = \\sum_{x\\in G / H} \\widehat{\\chi}\\left(x^{-1}gx \\right),"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \psi (g)=\sum _{x\in G/H}{\widehat {\chi }}\left(x^{-1}gx\right),}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>ψ<!-- ψ --></mi>
