</span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/984e8832b312275b350ffa01c9363dbc8cb5b25e" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:81.422ex; height:3.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \operatorname {ind} _{H}^{G}\pi =\left\{\phi \colon G\to V\ :\ \phi (gh^{-1})=\pi (h)\phi (g){\text{ and }}\phi {\text{ has compact support mod }}H\right\}.}"/></span></dd></dl>

<p id="mw4g">Note that if <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt104" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw4w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;G&apos;&apos;/&apos;&apos;H&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>G</i>/<i>H</i></span> is compact then Ind and ind are the same functor.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mw5A" aria-labelledby="Geometric"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Geometric">Geometric</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Induced_representation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Geometric"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mw5Q">Suppose <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt105" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topological_group" title="Topological group" id="mw5w">topological group</a> and <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt106" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"H"}},"i":0}}]}'>H</span> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Closed_set" title="Closed set" id="mw6Q">closed</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subgroup" title="Subgroup" id="mw6g">subgroup</a> of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt107" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span>. Also, suppose <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt108" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&amp;pi;"}},"i":0}}]}'><span typeof="mw:Entity">π</span></span> is a representation of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt109" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"H"}},"i":0}}]}'>H</span> over the vector space <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt110" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>V</i></span>. Then <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt111" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Group_action_(mathematics)" title="Group action (mathematics)" class="mw-redirect" id="mw8A">acts</a> on the product <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt112" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw8Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;G&apos;&apos; × &apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>G</i> × <i>V</i></span>  as follows:</p>
<dl id="mw8g"><dd id="mw8w"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt113" id="mw9A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"g.(g&apos;,x)=(gg&apos;,x)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle g.(g',x)=(gg',x)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>g</mi>
        <mo>.</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>g</mi>
          <mo>′</mo>
        </msup>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>g</mi>
        <msup>
          <mi>g</mi>
          <mo>′</mo>
        </msup>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle g.(g',x)=(gg',x)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c07582cd0fc8531ad27a730016d07442ade399ee" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:18.316ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle g.(g',x)=(gg',x)}"/></span></dd></dl>
<p id="mw9Q">where <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt114" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw9g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;g&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>g</i></span> and <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt115" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw9w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;g&apos;&apos;′"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>g</i>′</span> are elements of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt116" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span> and <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt117" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;x&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>x</i></span> is an element of <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt118" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>V</i></span>.</p>

<p id="mw-w">Define on  <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt119" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;G&apos;&apos; × &apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>G</i> × <i>V</i></span>  the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equivalence_relation" title="Equivalence relation" id="mw_Q">equivalence relation</a></p>

<dl id="mw_g"><dd id="mw_w"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt120" id="mwAQA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(g,x) \\sim (gh,\\pi(h^{-1})(x)) \\text{ for all }h\\in H."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (g,x)\sim (gh,\pi (h^{-1})(x)){\text{ for all }}h\in H.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>g</mi>
