        <mi>g</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle (g,x)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3b7aa5f7a5f01c682859c0b240b17c6fab19895a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:5.289ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (g,x)}"/></span> by <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt130" id="mwAQM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[g,x]"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [g,x]}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mi>g</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle [g,x]}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ac9419573343aaaaf5af8e1cccde6dbbf67765de" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:4.773ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle [g,x]}"/></span>. Note that this equivalence relation is invariant under the action of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt121" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span>; consequently, <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt122" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"G"}},"i":0}}]}'>G</span>  acts on <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt123" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"(&apos;&apos;G&apos;&apos; × &apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;)/~"}},"i":0}}]}'>(<i>G</i> × <i>V</i>)/~</span> . The latter is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vector_bundle" title="Vector bundle" id="mwAQc">vector bundle</a> over the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quotient_space_(topology)" title="Quotient space (topology)" id="mwAQg">quotient space</a> <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt124" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;G&apos;&apos;/&apos;&apos;H&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>G</i>/<i>H</i></span> with <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt125" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;H&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>H</i></span> as the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Structure_group" title="Structure group" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAQs">structure group</a> and <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt126" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;V&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>V</i></span> as the fiber. Let <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt127" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"math","href":"./Template:Math"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;W&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><i>W</i></span> be the space of sections <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt131" id="mwAQ4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\phi : G/H \\to (G \\times V)/ \\! \\sim"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \phi :G/H\to (G\times V)/\!\sim }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
