      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \phi :G/H\to (G\times V)/\!\sim }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/8288082eef7fe22b980a086ca8a13f7f6bf03db5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:23.482ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \phi :G/H\to (G\times V)/\!\sim }"/></span> of this vector bundle. This is the vector space underlying the induced representation <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt132" id="mwAQ8" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\operatorname{Ind}_H^G\\pi : W \\to \\mathcal L_W"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \operatorname {Ind} _{H}^{G}\pi :W\to {\mathcal {L}}_{W}}">
